{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國多個學區正採取措施封禁谷歌的人工智能功能，並且考慮徹底棄用谷歌全系產品——除非谷歌為他們提供可以永久屏蔽AI功能的方案。這讓學區與這家科技巨頭產生對立，谷歌的Chromebook筆記本以及配套教學工具已經深度嵌入美國各地課堂。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588250.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:44:29.471737+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:28:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_hash":"2c2e5413bc9ae436fd2b11a7fe33eb8b80d21b909629d7b5ca17faa454e2f3c2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}